{% import 'stability.j2' as stability %}
{% macro filter(member) %}{% if (member.deprecated is undefined or member.deprecated is none) %}{{ "True" }}{% else %}{{ "False" }}{% endif %}{% endmacro %}
{#- True if the only real member is the generic `other`/`_OTHER` fallback (as on
    error.type). A table with just that one row isn't worth showing on every page
    that uses the attribute, though the registry page still shows it. -#}
{% macro is_fallback_only(members) %}{% set ns = namespace(active=[]) %}{% for m in members %}{% if filter(m) == "True" %}{% set ns.active = [ns.active, [m]] | flatten %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if (ns.active | length == 1) and (ns.active[0].id == "other") %}{{ "True" }}{% else %}{{ "False" }}{% endif %}{% endmacro %}
{% macro table(enum, notes) %}
---

`{{enum.name}}` has the following list of well-known values. If one of them applies, then the respective value MUST be used; otherwise, a custom value MAY be used.

| Value | Description | Stability |
| --- | --- | --- |
{% for espec in enum.type.members | sort(attribute='value') %}
{%- if filter(espec) == "True" -%}
| `{{ espec.value }}` | {{ notes.table_cell((espec.brief or espec.id) | trim) }}{{ notes.add({"note": espec.note}) }} | {{ stability.badge(espec.stability, espec.deprecated, espec.brief) }} |
{% endif %}{% endfor %}{{ notes.render() }}{% endmacro %}
{% macro tables(enums, notes) -%}
{% for enum in enums | sort(attribute="name") -%}
{%- if is_fallback_only(enum.type.members) == "False" -%}{{ table(enum, notes) -}}{%- endif -%}
{% endfor %}{% endmacro %}
{% macro field_table(enum, notes) %}{% if is_fallback_only(enum.members) == "False" %}
`{{enum.id}}` has the following list of well-known values. If one of them applies, then the respective value MUST be used; otherwise, a custom value MAY be used.

| Value | Description | Stability |
| --- | --- | --- |
{% for espec in enum.members | sort(attribute='value') %}
{%- if filter(espec) == "True" -%}
| `{{ espec.value }}` | {{ notes.table_cell((espec.brief or espec.id) | trim) }}{{ notes.add({"note": espec.note}) }} | {{ stability.badge(espec.stability, espec.deprecated, espec.brief) }} |
{% endif %}{% endfor %}{{ notes.render() }}{% endif %}{% endmacro %}
{% macro field_tables(enums, notes) -%}
{% for enum in enums | sort(attribute="id") -%}
{{ field_table(enum, notes) -}}
{% endfor %}{% endmacro %}